    "reviews": "\u201cEven if you\u2019ve never played a Sokoban-like game, this is a great title to choose for your first one\u201d<br>\ud83d\udc4d \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br><br>\u201cThis time, its a new concept and i\u00b4m pleasently surprised. [...] This puts the Sokoban principle on a new and fresh Level.\u201d<br>\ud83d\udc4d \u2013 Wyvern-of-the-Rising-Sun - Steam User<br><br>\u201cThe game stands out for offering very natural movements and sounds from Mimi, along with fantastic animations. In the sokoban genre, the unique gameplay of &quot;Mimi the Cat - Mimi's Scratcher&quot; makes it an interesting choice for cat lovers.\u201d<br>\ud83d\udc4d \u2013 Overload Games<br>",
